qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Dieses Hotel ist gut, aber das Hotel am See ist noch <b>besser</b>.</div>gut의 비교급은 불규칙형 besser예요. noch는 비교급을 강조해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;am schnellsten&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Von allen Kindern in der Klasse rechnet Mia <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:16ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(schnell · 최상급)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">반 아이들 중에서 미아가 계산을 제일 빨리 해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Von allen Kindern in der Klasse rechnet Mia <b>am schnellsten</b>.</div>동사를 꾸미는 최상급은 am -sten이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Das ist der <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Turm der Stadt.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) höchsten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) höchste</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) hochste</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) am höchsten</button></div><div class=\"qe\">hoch의 최상급은 höchst-예요. 명사 앞에서는 der + -e(남성 1격)를 붙여요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> 바른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Meine Schwester kocht besser wie ich.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Meine Schwester kocht besser als mich.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Meine Schwester kocht guter als ich.</button>