utton type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">nicht</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Heute ist es nicht so windig wie gestern.</b></div>'~만큼 ~하지 않다'는 nicht so + 원급 + wie예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;schnelleren&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> Ich brauche einen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(schnell · 비교급)</span> Laptop für die Arbeit.</div><div class=\"qko\">일할 때 쓸 더 빠른 노트북이 필요해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich brauche einen <b>schnelleren</b> Laptop für die Arbeit.</div>비교급 schneller에 형용사 어미를 붙여요. einen + 남성 4격 → schnelleren.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;billigsten&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Wir übernachten im <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:12ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(billig · 최상급)</span> Hotel der Stadt.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 그 도시에서 가장 싼 호텔에 묵어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir übernachten im <b>billigsten</b> Hotel der Stadt.</div>최상급 billigst-에 어미를 붙여요. im = in dem, 3격 → -en.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Mein Bruder isst <span class=\"qblank\"></span> viel wie ich.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) doppelt als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) zweimal als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) doppelt so</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) doppelt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'두 배'는 doppelt so + 원급 + wie예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Je öfter ich übe desto sicherer werde ich&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">연습을 자주 할수록 더 자신감이 생겨요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">sicherer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">werde</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Je</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">desto</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">öfter</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">übe</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Je öfter ich übe, desto sicherer werde ich.</b></div>je 부분은 동사가 끝(übe), desto + 비교급 바로 뒤에 동사(werde)가 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;viel&quot;],[&quot;zu&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Zu Fuß ist der Weg <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(훨씬)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(너무)</span> weit. Wir nehmen lieber den Bus.</div><div class=\"qko\">걸어가기에는 길이 지나치게 멀어요. 차라리 버스를 타요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Zu Fuß ist der Weg <b>viel</b> <b>zu</b> weit. Wir nehmen lieber den Bus.</div>zu를 강조할 때는 viel zu예요. 멀어서 걸어갈 수 없으니 zu를 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Wo ist hier die <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Apotheke?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) näheste</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) nächste</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) nahste</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) nächsten</button></div><div class=\"qe\">nah의 최상급은 불규칙형 nächst-예요. die + 여성 1격 → nächste.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;meisten&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Die <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(viel · 최상급)</span> Schüler haben den Test geschafft.</div><div class=\"qko\">대부분의 학생이 그 테스트를 통과했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die <b>meisten</b> Schüler haben den Test geschafft.</div>viel의 최상급 meist-는 정관사와 함께 '대부분'이라는 뜻이에요 — die meisten.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> Lena verdient genauso viel <span class=\"qblank\"></span> ihr Mann, aber sie arbeitet weniger <span class=\"qblank\"></span> er.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) als – wie</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) wie – als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) als – als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) wie – wie</button></div><div class=\"qe\">같은 정도(genauso viel)는 wie, 비교급(weniger) 뒤는 als예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장을 고르세요.</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Mein Weg zur Arbeit ist kürzer als deiner.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Das ist das interessanteste Museum in Wien.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Je länger ich warte, desto nervöser ich werde.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Im Winter ist es hier am kältesten.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">desto + 비교급 바로 뒤에 동사가 와요 — desto nervöser werde ich.<br>interessant는 -t로 끝나서 interessanteste가 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;jünger&quot;],[&quot;so&quot;,&quot;genauso&quot;,&quot;ebenso&quot;,&quot;gleich&quot;],[&quot;wie&quot;],[&quot;am jüngsten&quot;,&quot;der jüngste&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Lukas ist 15, Jan 13 und Tim auch 15.<br>Jan ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(jung)</span> als Lukas. Tim ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> alt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"> Lukas. Von den drei Jungen ist Jan <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(jung · 최상급)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">루카스는 15살, 얀은 13살, 팀도 15살이에요. 얀은 루카스보다 어려요. 팀은 루카스와 나이가 같아요. 세 소년 중에서 얀이 가장 어려요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Lukas ist 15, Jan 13 und Tim auch 15.<br>Jan ist <b>jünger</b> als Lukas. Tim ist <b>so</b> alt <b>wie</b> Lukas. Von den drei Jungen ist Jan <b>am jüngsten</b>.</div>jung은 움라우트가 붙어요 — jünger · am jüngsten(der jüngste도 돼요).<br>차이가 있으면 비교급 + als, 같으면 so … wie예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;höchste&quot;],[&quot;höhere&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> Der Feldberg ist der <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(hoch · 최상급)</span> Gipfel im Schwarzwald, aber in den Alpen findet man viel <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(hoch · 비교급)</span> Gipfel.</div><div class=\"qko\">펠트베르크는 슈바르츠발트에서 가장 높은 산이지만, 알프스에는 훨씬 더 높은 산들이 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Feldberg ist der <b>höchste</b> Gipfel im Schwarzwald, aber in den Alpen findet man viel <b>höhere</b> Gipfel.</div>der + 남성 1격 → höchste.<br>관사 없는 복수 4격은 강변화 -e예요. hoch의 비교급 höher + e → höhere. viel은 비교급을 강조해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;sehr&quot;],[&quot;zu&quot;],[&quot;genug&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Unsere Wohnung ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(sehr · zu · genug 중 하나)</span> schön, wir wohnen gern hier. Aber jetzt ist sie <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(sehr · zu · genug 중 하나)</span> klein für uns vier – wir müssen umziehen. Leider haben wir nicht <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(sehr · zu · genug 중 하나)</span> Geld für eine größere.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 집은 아주 예뻐서 여기 사는 게 좋아요. 그런데 이제 우리 넷이 살기에는 너무 작아서 이사해야 해요. 아쉽게도 더 큰 집을 얻을 돈은 충분하지 않아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Unsere Wohnung ist <b>sehr</b> schön, wir wohnen gern hier. Aber jetzt ist sie <b>zu</b> klein für uns vier – wir müssen umziehen. Leider haben wir nicht <b>genug</b> Geld für eine größere.</div>① 좋아서 하는 말(칭찬)이라 sehr예요. zu를 쓰면 '지나치게 예쁘다'는 이상한 뜻이 돼요.<br>② 작아서 이사해야 하니 지나침의 zu예요 — zu klein für uns vier.<br>③ 명사 앞의 '충분히'는 genug + 명사예요 — genug Geld.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> 알맞은 것은? — Im neuen Job habe ich <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Zeit und <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Stress.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) mehr – weniger</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) mehr – wenigeren</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) mehrere – weniger</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) mehre – wenigeren</button></div><div class=\"qe\">mehr와 weniger는 명사 앞에서도 어미를 붙이지 않아요.<br>mehrere는 '여러 개의'라는 뜻이라 셀 수 없는 Zeit와 쓰지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;In den Ferien fahren die meisten Familien lieber ans Meer als in die Berge&quot;,&quot;Die meisten Familien fahren in den Ferien lieber ans Meer als in die Berge&quot;,&quot;Die meisten Familien fahren lieber in den Ferien ans Meer als in die Berge&quot;,&quot;Lieber fahren die meisten Familien in den Ferien ans Meer als in die Berge&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">방학 때 대부분의 가족은 산보다 바다로 가는 걸 더 좋아해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">als</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">lieber</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Meer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">den</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">fahren</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Berge</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Familien</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">ans</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"10\">In</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"11\">Ferien</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"12\">meisten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"13\">in</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>In den Ferien fahren die meisten Familien lieber ans Meer als in die Berge.</b></div>lieber는 gern의 비교급이에요. 비교 대상 in die Berge는 als 뒤, 문장 맨 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"